      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      54.01,
      595.9,
      542.52,
      633.37
    ],
    "text": "2. The Repatriation of Export Proceeds into Sri Lanka Rules No. 01 of 2024 issued by the Central Bank of Sri Lanka and published in the Gazette (Extraordinary) Notification No. 2391/02 dated 01st July 2024, are hereby amended by the repeal of Rule 4(v) thereof and the substitution therefor, of the following new Rule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
